\section{Attaching files to records}{

Uploading a file does not attach it to a record. Write the returned IDs into
an \code{Attachments} column as a list-column:

\if{html}{\out{<div class="sourceCode r">}}\preformatted{ids <- grist_attachments_upload(doc, c("a.pdf", "b.pdf"))

